@startuml
title Borehole Risk Prediction - State Diagram

[*] --> Registered

Registered --> AwaitingInspection
AwaitingInspection --> DataEntered : Expert enters information
DataEntered --> ModelUnavailable : Model not trained
ModelUnavailable --> AwaitingInspection : District Officer trains model

DataEntered --> RiskCalculated : Model available
RiskCalculated --> LowRisk : Risk below 60%
RiskCalculated --> HighRisk : Risk at least 60%

HighRisk --> OfficerNotified
OfficerNotified --> MaintenancePending
LowRisk --> Monitoring

MaintenancePending --> UnderMaintenance : Trainee starts work
UnderMaintenance --> MaintenanceCompleted : Work recorded
MaintenanceCompleted --> AwaitingInspection : Reassessment required

Monitoring --> AwaitingInspection : New inspection
@enduml
